==Strategy==
This stage has the same schematics as [[Bionic Seaweed]], just with added Loincloth Cats.

[[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|Snipers]] and [[:Category:Super-Backliner-class Cats|Super Backliners]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] can be stacked during the first part of the fight to deal with the Loincloth Cats. Spam meatshields and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]] to kill the Metal Doges so they don't overwhelm you. After you progress to the base, lure the [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]] a little bit so that your [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critters]] can stay out of the Loincloths' range. While your long-range attackers slow and deal damage to the enemy Cats, hope to get [[Critical Hit]]s on the Metal enemies. [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]] and [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Puppetmaster & Charley]] can help keeping the Metal enemies from progressing closer towards your backline units.

